## Original Content
The measures come after President Trump imposed 50% tariffs on many Canadian goods and threatened more after trade talks broke down on Friday.

## Summary
Canada has imposed retaliatory tariffs on the United States in response to President Trump's earlier tariffs on Canadian goods. The escalation follows the breakdown of trade talks and threats of further measures from the U.S.

## Key Points
- Canada announced retaliatory tariffs on the U.S.
- This is a direct response to President Trump's imposition of 50% tariffs on Canadian goods.
- Trade talks between the two countries collapsed on Friday, leading to increased tensions.


